# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/uair
# (f., 2nd declension: genitive "uaire", plural "uaireanta").
# The counted plural is the irregular "uaire", which the same entry's usage
# note gives with its mutations spelled out -- h-prothesis after three to
# six ("trí huaire", "cúig huaire") and eclipsis after seven to ten
# ("seacht n-uaire").  Both mutated surfaces are listed, so a counted phrase
# matches whichever the numeral before it imposes.
uair
uaire
uaireanta
uaireanna
huaire
n-uaire
n uaire
